    "description": {
      "value": "This finely crafted, seemingly mundane parchment is useful for writing sensitive documents. When words are written on this parchment, they instantly scramble into unrecognizable script, requiring a DC 20 check to Decipher Writing.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n\nThe scrambled words align into the originally written script. Identifying the parchment reveals that it can be activated with a command, but a critical success to Identify Magic is needed to learn the command word.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n\nYou light the parchment on fire, burning the words off while leaving the parchment unharmed and ready to bear more text.\n\nThe DC to Decipher Writing is 30 and requires master proficiency."
    },
